1
00:00:07,120 --> 00:00:08,400
Was tonight's

2
00:00:09,400 --> 00:00:11,119
show your idea?

3
00:00:14,199 --> 00:00:15,519
Do I qualify

4
00:00:15,519 --> 00:00:17,440
to drive for you now, Ms. Song Huan?

5
00:00:30,760 --> 00:00:31,839
Nice dress.

6
00:00:34,200 --> 00:00:35,320
Too bad

7
00:00:37,159 --> 00:00:38,200
borrowed light

8
00:00:38,880 --> 00:00:40,359
never lasts past midnight.

9
00:00:43,960 --> 00:00:45,119
Ms. Song Huan,

10
00:00:45,799 --> 00:00:47,359
I don't want to live
in someone else's light.

11
00:00:47,920 --> 00:00:49,359
I want to be the light.

12
00:00:50,240 --> 00:00:51,119
Just like you.

13
00:00:52,119 --> 00:00:53,920
So if I ever get the chance,

14
00:00:54,200 --> 00:00:56,320
I'd like to learn by your side.

15
00:01:00,520 --> 00:01:01,320
Song Cheng.

16
00:01:02,840 --> 00:01:03,960
Song Cheng, get out here!

17
00:01:05,920 --> 00:01:06,719
You illegitimate brat!

18
00:01:07,799 --> 00:01:08,319
What's wrong with you?

19
00:01:08,319 --> 00:01:09,159
You illegitimate brat!

20
00:01:10,599 --> 00:01:11,400
Lin.

21
00:01:11,599 --> 00:01:13,560
Don't think I don't know
what you're up to.

22
00:01:13,840 --> 00:01:15,599
You're helping Song Huan
steal the family fortune from me,

23
00:01:15,599 --> 00:01:16,480
aren't you?

24
00:01:17,439 --> 00:01:17,959
Lin, you...

25
00:01:17,959 --> 00:01:19,200
Have you been drinking?

26
00:01:19,760 --> 00:01:22,040
I'm going to teach you a lesson
right now!

27
00:01:22,280 --> 00:01:23,079
Yu Song!

28
00:01:23,799 --> 00:01:24,599
Ms. Song Cheng.

29
00:01:25,040 --> 00:01:26,400
That's for showing off!

30
00:01:26,760 --> 00:01:27,680
And that's for helping her!

31
00:01:29,480 --> 00:01:30,400
Go on, scream!

32
00:01:30,519 --> 00:01:31,599
See who's going to save you!

33
00:01:31,599 --> 00:01:32,760
I've got some work

34
00:01:33,159 --> 00:01:34,439
- to take care of at the office.
- You illegitimate child!

35
00:01:34,719 --> 00:01:35,519
I've been drinking.

36
00:01:37,519 --> 00:01:39,840
I'll make an exception for you.

37
00:01:40,760 --> 00:01:42,319
I'll let you choose.

38
00:01:43,120 --> 00:01:43,799
Drive me,

39
00:01:44,680 --> 00:01:45,719
or save her?

40
00:02:00,347 --> 00:02:04,707
=Dear Song=

41
00:02:04,872 --> 00:02:07,385
=Episode 8=
(The Loyal Traitor)

42
00:02:15,520 --> 00:02:16,719
Nice driving.

43
00:02:18,520 --> 00:02:19,319
Very smooth.

44
00:02:20,120 --> 00:02:21,319
Thanks for the compliment.

45
00:02:39,759 --> 00:02:41,159
Did I hurt you?

46
00:02:52,719 --> 00:02:53,639
What's wrong?

47
00:02:57,400 --> 00:02:58,199
Yu Song.

48
00:03:00,840 --> 00:03:01,879
Did you

49
00:03:03,039 --> 00:03:04,639
really want to help me today,

50
00:03:05,960 --> 00:03:07,319
or were you just using me

51
00:03:08,719 --> 00:03:10,120
to work for Huan?

52
00:03:11,400 --> 00:03:12,199
I saw

53
00:03:12,800 --> 00:03:14,639
you two talking on the terrace
for a long time.

54
00:03:21,000 --> 00:03:23,120
If I wanted to work for Song Huan,

55
00:03:23,520 --> 00:03:25,719
I wouldn't be here
putting medicine on you right now.

56
00:03:27,560 --> 00:03:28,439
Why?

57
00:03:29,759 --> 00:03:31,560
If you work for Huan,

58
00:03:31,919 --> 00:03:33,319
you'll have better prospects.

59
00:03:33,840 --> 00:03:34,639
Staying with me,

60
00:03:35,800 --> 00:03:37,240
you'll only suffer.

61
00:03:51,919 --> 00:03:52,960
Open it.

62
00:03:59,919 --> 00:04:00,800
Ms. Song Cheng,

63
00:04:01,560 --> 00:04:02,400
what's this...?

64
00:04:04,120 --> 00:04:05,719
I know you play the piano.

65
00:04:06,120 --> 00:04:07,439
If I get the chance,

66
00:04:08,199 --> 00:04:09,319
I'd like us both

67
00:04:10,360 --> 00:04:12,319
to stand in the light together.

68
00:04:22,160 --> 00:04:23,040
Ms. Song Cheng.

69
00:04:24,399 --> 00:04:25,759
I appreciate the thought.

70
00:04:26,040 --> 00:04:27,439
But it's not proper.

71
00:04:28,160 --> 00:04:29,560
I'm just your personal assistant.

72
00:04:29,759 --> 00:04:31,240
I shouldn't be
the center of attention tonight.

73
00:04:31,720 --> 00:04:33,040
Tonight,

74
00:04:33,040 --> 00:04:34,439
you're my good friend.

75
00:04:34,639 --> 00:04:36,199
Just like everyone else out there.

76
00:04:37,000 --> 00:04:39,000
I haven't played in a long time.

77
00:04:39,120 --> 00:04:41,199
Just think of it as giving me
some courage.

78
00:04:41,199 --> 00:04:42,160
Alright?

79
00:04:43,240 --> 00:04:44,959
You said you'd always protect me.

80
00:04:45,399 --> 00:04:46,480
And

81
00:04:46,759 --> 00:04:48,160
it's just a dress.

82
00:04:49,360 --> 00:04:50,560
You deserve the best.

83
00:04:52,439 --> 00:04:53,240
Okay.

84
00:04:54,319 --> 00:04:55,199
I'll do it.

85
00:04:58,519 --> 00:04:59,360
Ms. Song Cheng,

86
00:05:00,360 --> 00:05:02,319
I suggest you two take on
the horse ranch project together.

87
00:05:02,920 --> 00:05:04,600
Because you can't afford two enemies

88
00:05:04,600 --> 00:05:06,199
in the Song family at once.

89
00:05:06,199 --> 00:05:07,319
Song Huan

90
00:05:07,680 --> 00:05:09,199
can be a temporary ally right now.

91
00:05:12,319 --> 00:05:13,519
I'm sorry, Yu Song.

92
00:05:14,560 --> 00:05:16,199
I was just so afraid of losing you.

93
00:05:30,519 --> 00:05:32,160
I'll always be here with you.

94
00:05:58,040 --> 00:06:00,399
Mr. Zhao, that's no way

95
00:06:01,040 --> 00:06:02,240
for a gentleman like you to act.

96
00:06:02,319 --> 00:06:03,399
Are you out of your mind?

97
00:06:03,720 --> 00:06:05,600
You'd risk offending Song Huan
over an illegitimate daughter?

98
00:06:05,959 --> 00:06:08,519
You blew our best chance
to get close to her!

99
00:06:09,160 --> 00:06:10,120
I told you,

100
00:06:11,040 --> 00:06:12,160
I've got my own plan.

101
00:06:12,160 --> 00:06:12,920
Plan?

102
00:06:13,160 --> 00:06:15,600
Your plan is to send Jing
to drive Song Huan?

103
00:06:16,360 --> 00:06:17,120
Yu Song,

104
00:06:17,120 --> 00:06:19,319
don't get so full of yourself.

105
00:06:19,519 --> 00:06:20,959
Song Huan isn't Song Cheng.

106
00:06:20,959 --> 00:06:23,399
She's not some pathetic soul
waiting around for your pity!

107
00:06:23,839 --> 00:06:25,959
Say one more word,

108
00:06:25,959 --> 00:06:27,199
and I'll tell the Song family

109
00:06:27,199 --> 00:06:29,519
about you bugging Song Huan
and your past as a male escort.

110
00:06:29,519 --> 00:06:31,120
Let's see who needs the Song family

111
00:06:31,120 --> 00:06:32,360
more, you or me.

112
00:06:35,959 --> 00:06:38,800
What Song Huan hates most
is disloyalty from those around her.

113
00:06:38,800 --> 00:06:41,199
If I'd picked her over Song Cheng today,

114
00:06:41,199 --> 00:06:43,120
she'd never trust me.

115
00:06:43,199 --> 00:06:43,920
(Zhao Hui.)

116
00:06:44,439 --> 00:06:45,160
(Zhao Hui!)

117
00:06:45,600 --> 00:06:46,920
(Where the hell are you?)

118
00:06:48,240 --> 00:06:48,839
Hey.

119
00:06:49,959 --> 00:06:51,120
No rush.

120
00:06:51,360 --> 00:06:51,639
What...

121
00:06:52,000 --> 00:06:53,120
What are you doing?

122
00:06:53,360 --> 00:06:54,240
So,

123
00:06:54,680 --> 00:06:56,079
do I call her over,

124
00:06:56,079 --> 00:06:57,720
or do you leave on your own?

125
00:06:59,759 --> 00:07:00,560
Fine!

126
00:07:01,439 --> 00:07:02,519
We'll do it your way.

127
00:07:18,759 --> 00:07:19,480
Mr. Song,

128
00:07:19,839 --> 00:07:20,600
you wanted to see me?

129
00:07:22,040 --> 00:07:23,439
Dropped Song Huan off at the office?

130
00:07:23,439 --> 00:07:24,240
Yes.

131
00:07:27,040 --> 00:07:27,959
Did you know

132
00:07:28,480 --> 00:07:29,839
Yu Song before?

133
00:07:34,199 --> 00:07:34,839
No.

134
00:07:35,120 --> 00:07:37,600
But Ms. Song Cheng seems
pretty happy with her.

135
00:07:40,959 --> 00:07:42,319
Look into her.

136
00:07:43,199 --> 00:07:44,120
I've got a feeling

137
00:07:44,560 --> 00:07:45,920
there's more to her than meets the eye.

138
00:07:49,000 --> 00:07:49,800
Okay.

139
00:07:50,959 --> 00:07:51,319
Go ahead.

140
00:08:02,000 --> 00:08:02,360
Come on. Come on.

141
00:08:02,839 --> 00:08:03,839
- Happy New Year.
- Happy New Year.

142
00:08:03,920 --> 00:08:04,560
(Spring Festival)
Happy New Year.

143
00:08:04,800 --> 00:08:05,519
- Happy New Year.
- Happy New Year.

144
00:08:05,519 --> 00:08:06,240
Come on. Come on.

145
00:08:06,240 --> 00:08:07,120
Have some of this.

146
00:08:07,839 --> 00:08:08,959
Eat up, sweetie.

147
00:08:08,959 --> 00:08:09,720
Eat up.

148
00:08:11,959 --> 00:08:13,639
Yu Song, you're back.

149
00:08:14,519 --> 00:08:16,560
Weren't you spending New Year's Eve
somewhere else?

150
00:08:17,000 --> 00:08:18,519
I came back to grab a few things.

151
00:08:19,720 --> 00:08:21,399
There's nothing of yours here anymore.

152
00:08:21,399 --> 00:08:23,639
The money your dad left is long gone.

153
00:08:23,800 --> 00:08:25,040
As for the rest,

154
00:08:25,959 --> 00:08:27,519
don't even think about it.

155
00:08:37,399 --> 00:08:38,000
Right.

156
00:08:38,440 --> 00:08:41,240
I can see exactly
where my dad's money went

157
00:08:41,399 --> 00:08:42,440
these past few years.

158
00:08:44,759 --> 00:08:45,759
Stinky Fish Beggar,

159
00:08:45,919 --> 00:08:46,960
what are you looking at?

160
00:08:48,720 --> 00:08:50,360
Even if you wore these new clothes,

161
00:08:50,559 --> 00:08:51,840
you'd still reek of fish.

162
00:08:53,519 --> 00:08:55,159
Actually, that old school uniform

163
00:08:55,440 --> 00:08:56,399
suits you better.

164
00:08:57,240 --> 00:08:57,799
Play nice.

165
00:08:58,480 --> 00:08:59,039
Play nice.

166
00:08:59,039 --> 00:08:59,960
Have a seat.

167
00:09:00,720 --> 00:09:02,759
We still need her to agree
to the deal with that old cripple.

168
00:09:08,639 --> 00:09:09,720
Dropped Song Huan off?

169
00:09:09,720 --> 00:09:10,519
Yeah.

170
00:09:10,799 --> 00:09:12,240
All she did the whole ride was

171
00:09:12,240 --> 00:09:13,039
compliment my driving.

172
00:09:14,159 --> 00:09:15,600
That's so Song Huan.

173
00:09:16,759 --> 00:09:19,360
I think I've already got
her initial approval.

174
00:09:21,759 --> 00:09:22,559
Go on.

175
00:09:24,320 --> 00:09:26,960
I don't think Song Huan is actually

176
00:09:26,960 --> 00:09:28,559
as trusted by Song Huaishan
as she seems.

177
00:09:28,960 --> 00:09:32,320
Deep down, she might feel
even less secure than Song Cheng.

178
00:09:32,559 --> 00:09:34,320
What she needs most is loyalty.

179
00:09:34,320 --> 00:09:37,200
If I hadn't chosen Song Cheng today,

180
00:09:37,559 --> 00:09:39,039
she'd never use me.

181
00:09:39,519 --> 00:09:41,919
But because I stood by Song Cheng,

182
00:09:42,120 --> 00:09:44,720
she might actually see me
as someone useful.

183
00:09:45,320 --> 00:09:46,320
You're that sure?

184
00:09:46,919 --> 00:09:49,639
There's always a 1% chance
things could go wrong.

185
00:09:50,399 --> 00:09:51,519
Tomorrow will tell

186
00:09:51,519 --> 00:09:52,360
if I'm right.

187
00:09:54,559 --> 00:09:55,960
You barely ate tonight.

188
00:09:56,240 --> 00:09:57,440
I got your favorite wontons.

189
00:09:58,600 --> 00:09:59,320
Thanks,

190
00:09:59,519 --> 00:10:00,320
Mr. Jing.

191
00:10:01,320 --> 00:10:01,919
So

192
00:10:02,120 --> 00:10:03,000
same deal as always?

193
00:10:03,000 --> 00:10:03,799
Sell it for 80% of its value?

194
00:10:05,519 --> 00:10:06,720
I want to keep this one.

195
00:10:07,840 --> 00:10:09,240
I really like this trophy.

196
00:10:10,120 --> 00:10:10,879
Eat.

197
00:10:26,880 --> 00:10:28,280
(GangA 96690)

198
00:10:38,600 --> 00:10:39,559
Ms. Song Huan.

199
00:10:41,159 --> 00:10:41,960
Get in.

200
00:10:42,720 --> 00:10:43,799
Take me to the office.

201
00:10:46,240 --> 00:10:47,320
After you.

202
00:10:47,360 --> 00:10:53,420
(Fuxing Bridge)

203
00:10:53,780 --> 00:10:56,020
(Qiushi Elevated Road)

204
00:10:56,611 --> 00:10:59,532
(Bodi Center, Xintai Insurance)

205
00:11:03,176 --> 00:11:04,763
(China Enterprise DataLink)

206
00:11:05,500 --> 00:11:07,060
(GangA 96690)

207
00:11:08,200 --> 00:11:09,120
Ms. Song Huan,

208
00:11:09,120 --> 00:11:10,000
we're here.

209
00:11:13,720 --> 00:11:15,120
You did well yesterday.

210
00:11:15,799 --> 00:11:17,039
Thank you, Ms. Song Huan.

211
00:11:20,440 --> 00:11:21,879
Have we met before?

212
00:11:24,759 --> 00:11:25,840
I just have one of those faces.

213
00:11:26,320 --> 00:11:28,120
You've probably got the wrong person.

214
00:11:31,519 --> 00:11:32,000
Speak.

215
00:11:32,000 --> 00:11:32,679
(Ms. Song.)

216
00:11:32,679 --> 00:11:35,240
(We've picked out several plots
suitable for)

217
00:11:35,240 --> 00:11:36,519
(a hot spring hotel and a beauty salon.)

218
00:11:43,760 --> 00:11:45,480
(GangA 96690)

219
00:11:47,360 --> 00:11:49,360
(I'll email you the quote shortly.)

220
00:11:49,720 --> 00:11:51,159
(We can discuss it anytime
after you've reviewed it.)

221
00:12:06,799 --> 00:12:08,600
Interested in being my assistant?

222
00:12:12,919 --> 00:12:13,840
You drive well.

223
00:12:28,919 --> 00:12:30,320
Thank you, Ms. Song Huan.
